00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.539
ends up at the bottom of a lake.

00:02:05.539 --> 00:02:06.539
Okay.

00:02:06.539 --> 00:02:07.539
Right.

00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:10.190
But in some scenarios, the seatbelts will
save people.

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:11.381
So we should still do it.

00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:13.540
And then let's figure out what to do about
