00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.460
Maybe we need better guardrails on bridges
and simple things like this.

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.350
It's a similar sort of idea.

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:24.459
And it's it's it doesn't even remotely pass
the.

00:02:24.459 --> 00:02:27.880
I seriously want to fix this test.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.690
When people start with you're never going
to prevent every mass shooting or there's

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.280
