that we can make.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.480
And there's many improvements we can make.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.510
Speaker 3: Yeah, I mean, it applies to a lot
of other things.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:58.110
I just think that was probably the one that
